Solenne AI is a personal, closed-source project. It is not open source. 
You are free to download and use the compiled application for personal enjoyment, 
but the source code, custom assets, and builds remain my intellectual property.

## 1. WHAT YOU CAN DO (Permitted Use)

* **Play and Use:** You may download, install, and run the official builds of Solenne AI for personal, non-commercial entertainment on your own devices.
* **Share Links:** You may share links to this official repository, the release page, or official download archives with friends or on forums.
* **Share Presets:** You may create, share, and distribute your own custom text-based character presets (JSON files) and non-proprietary configurations.

## 2. WHAT YOU CANNOT DO (Restrictions)

Unless you have my explicit written permission, you may not:

* **No Reuploading:** Reupload the compiled binaries, installers, or the portable `Solenne Build` folders to third-party file hosts, torrent trackers, or other repositories.
* **No Source Code Theft:** Decompile, reverse engineer, or attempt to extract the source code from the compiled `companion.exe` binaries.
* **No Asset Stealing:** Unpack, decrypt, or extract the bundled encrypted 3D models (`.vrm.pack`), textures, or custom assets to use in other projects or redistribute them.
* **No Commercial Use:** Sell the app, bundle it with paid software, put it behind a paywall, or use it for any commercial purposes.
* **No Impersonation:** Claim you made Solenne AI, or remove/obscure my name and credits from the application and its interface.

## 3. THIRD-PARTY ASSETS & LIBRARIES

Solenne AI relies on several third-party libraries and assets that have their own licenses. I do not claim ownership of them, and by using the app, you agree to respect their original creators:

* **3D Animations:** Body animations are sourced from the **VRoid Project** (pixiv Inc.) and **Mixamo** (Adobe). They are licensed for use within this application and cannot be extracted or redistributed.
* **Voice Models:** Local voice synthesis uses **Silero** models (licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) and **Edge TTS** (Microsoft). 
* **AI & Speech:** Whisper (speech-to-text) and local LLM integrations are the property of their respective creators.
* **Repository Assets:** Screenshots, documentation, and UI files in this repository are provided for viewing and hosting purposes only; no license is granted to rip them as a template for another product.

## 4. NO WARRANTY (Indie Dev Disclaimer)

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. 
I am a solo developer sharing this project in my free time. I am not responsible for any bugs, crashes, data loss, or issues that might occur on your device while using the app. Use it at your own risk.

## 5. TERMINATION

If you break these rules (e.g., reuploading the game, stealing assets, or attempting to crack the model encryption), your right to use the software is immediately revoked, and you must delete all copies from your devices. Your personal local data (chats, diaries, settings) remains yours.

## 6. CONTACT

If you want to report a bug, suggest a feature, or just say hi, please open an issue on the repository or reach out via the contact info on the project page.
